What is the output of the following polymorphic greeting program?
```java
class Greeter {
    void sayHello() {
        System.out.print("Hello ");
    }
}
class FrenchGreeter extends Greeter {
    @Override
    void sayHello() {
        System.out.print("Bonjour ");
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Greeter g = new FrenchGreeter();
        g.sayHello();
    }
}
```

